---
import '../styles/global.css';
---

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>About · Zhimin</title>
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
    <link rel="alternate" type="application/rss+xml" title="RSS Feed" href="/rss.xml" />
  </head>
  <body>
    <main class="site-shell site-shell--compact">
      <a href="/" class="article-page__back">← Back</a>

      <section class="about-page__section">
        <div class="about-page__profile">
          <img src="/logo.svg" alt="Zhimin" class="about-page__avatar" />
          <div>
            <h1 class="about-page__name">Zhimin</h1>
            <p class="about-page__meta">安全研究 · 上海</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="about-page__bio">
          <p>文字留住瞬间。</p>
          <p>这里主要记录生活随笔、技术笔记，以及一些持续整理中的想法。</p>
        </div>

        <div class="about-page__links">
          <a href="https://github.com/gongzhimin" class="about-page__link">GH</a>
          <a href="mailto:zhimin.aisecty@gmail.com" class="about-page__link">@</a>
        </div>
      </section>

    </main>
